DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261024T211700
SUMMARY:Film: Portrait of a Lady on Fire (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Céline Sciamma · 122 min\n\nA painter is hired to secretly pa
 int a young woman's wedding portrait on a remote Breton island in the 1770
 s. It is a love story about looking and being looked at\, filmed like a se
 ries of paintings. Almost no men appear\, which quietly changes how we see
  everything.\n\nAfter: How does it change a portrait when the subject look
 s back at the artist? Think of a portrait from your art cards.\n\nWhere to
  watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Portrait%20of%20a%20Lady%20o
 n%20Fire
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Portrait%20of%20a%20Lady%20on%20F
 ire
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
