BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:film-20261031@daily-hub
DTSTAMP:20261022T233201Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261031T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261031T205900
SUMMARY:Film: The Square (2013)
DESCRIPTION:Jehane Noujaim · 104 min\n\nFollows activists in Tahrir Square
  from the 2011 revolution through the turbulent years that followed. It sh
 ows how hard it is to turn protest into lasting change. Made by an Egyptia
 n American director with people on the ground.\n\nAfter: Why do revolution
 s so often end differently from how they began? Think about populism.\n\nW
 here to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=The%20Square
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=The%20Square
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
