SUMMARY:Film: I Am Not Your Negro (2016)
DESCRIPTION:Raoul Peck · 93 min\n\nBuilt from James Baldwin's unfinished b
 ook about Medgar Evers\, Malcolm X and Martin Luther King Jr. Baldwin's wo
 rds\, read by Samuel L. Jackson\, are set against archive footage and the 
 present. A brilliant introduction to a brilliant writer.\n\nAfter: Which B
 aldwin line stayed with you? Save the quote card if it comes up.\n\nWhere 
 to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=I%20Am%20Not%20Your%20Negr
 o
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=I%20Am%20Not%20Your%20Negro
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
