SUMMARY:Film: Perfect Days (2023)
DESCRIPTION:Wim Wenders · 124 min\n\nA man who cleans Tokyo's public toile
 ts lives a quiet routine of work\, books\, music cassettes and photographi
 ng trees. Peaceful and meditative\, it finds meaning in small things. Kōj
 i Yakusho won Best Actor at Cannes.\n\nAfter: What would a 'perfect day' l
 ook like for you\, in very simple terms?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.ju
 stwatch.com/uk/search?q=Perfect%20Days
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Perfect%20Days
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
