SUMMARY:Film: A Separation (2011)
DESCRIPTION:Asghar Farhadi · 123 min\n\nA middle-class couple in Tehran sp
 lit over whether to leave Iran\, setting off a chain of misunderstandings 
 with their carer's family. Every character is partly right and partly wron
 g. It won the Oscar for Best Foreign Language Film.\n\nAfter: Which charac
 ter did you side with first\, and did that change? Try the debate question
  on this one.\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=A%2
 0Separation
