SUMMARY:Film: Amélie (2001)
DESCRIPTION:Jean-Pierre Jeunet · 122 min\n\nA shy café waitress in Montma
 rtre secretly fixes other people's lives while avoiding her own. Bright an
 d playful\, with glowing reds and greens. A light film\, but about lonelin
 ess underneath.\n\nAfter: What small kindness could change someone's day?\
 n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Am%C3%A9lie
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Am%C3%A9lie
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
