SUMMARY:Film: Faces Places (2017)
DESCRIPTION:Agnès Varda and JR · 89 min\n\nAgnès Varda\, nearly ninety\,
  travels rural France with the young photographer JR\, pasting giant portr
 aits of local people on walls\, barns and trains. Warm\, playful and touch
 ing about ageing and friendship.\n\nAfter: Whose face would you put on a w
 all in your town\, and why?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/u
 k/search?q=Faces%20Places
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Faces%20Places
