SUMMARY:Film: Past Lives (2023)
DESCRIPTION:Celine Song · 105 min\n\nTwo childhood friends from Seoul are 
 separated when one emigrates\, and reconnect decades later in New York. A 
 quiet film about the lives we did not live and the person migration made u
 s into. It earned two Oscar nominations\, including Best Picture.\n\nAfter
 : Who would you be if you had grown up somewhere else?\n\nWhere to watch: 
 https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Past%20Lives
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Past%20Lives
