SUMMARY:Film: Burning (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Lee Chang-dong · 148 min\n\nA young man meets a childhood acqu
 aintance and her rich\, mysterious new friend\, and becomes obsessed when 
 she disappears. Based on a Haruki Murakami story. A slow\, unsettling myst
 ery about class anger.\n\nAfter: Murakami appears on the Japan card. How d
 oes the film turn his story into one about Korean class divides?\n\nWhere 
 to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Burning
