SUMMARY:Film: Cinema Paradiso (1988)
DESCRIPTION:Giuseppe Tornatore · 124 min\n\nA film director returns to his
  Sicilian village and remembers growing up in the cinema with the projecti
 onist who became his father figure. A love letter to films and to memory. 
 The final scene is famous for making people cry.\n\nAfter: What place shap
 ed you most\, and what would you find if you went back?\n\nWhere to watch:
  https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Cinema%20Paradiso
