SUMMARY:Film: If Beale Street Could Talk (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Barry Jenkins · 119 min\n\nFrom the director of Moonlight\, ad
 apted from James Baldwin's novel. A young couple in 1970s Harlem have thei
 r future upended when he is falsely accused of a crime. It is tender\, war
 m and heartbreaking\, and its colours and close-ups are stunning.\n\nAfter
 : Baldwin wrote that nothing can be changed until it is faced. What does t
 his film ask its audience to face?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatc
 h.com/uk/search?q=If%20Beale%20Street%20Could%20Talk
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=If%20Beale%20Street%20Could%20Tal
 k
