SUMMARY:Film: Pan's Labyrinth (2006)
DESCRIPTION:Guillermo del Toro · 118 min\n\nIn 1944 Spain\, after the Civi
 l War\, a girl escapes her cruel fascist stepfather into a dark fairy-tale
  world. It links fantasy to political violence. Beautifully designed\, but
  scary in parts.\n\nAfter: Is the fantasy real\, or her way of resisting? 
 What does fascism do to imagination?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwa
 tch.com/uk/search?q=Pan's%20Labyrinth
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Pan's%20Labyrinth
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
