SUMMARY:Film: Honeyland (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Ljubomir Stefanov and Tamara Kotevska · 86 min\n\nOne of the l
 ast wild beekeepers in Europe lives with her mother in a remote village\, 
 taking only half the honey. Then a noisy family moves in next door. A smal
 l story about sustainability and greed\, filmed beautifully.\n\nAfter: Wha
 t is the environmentalist case made by this film\, without any speech?\n\n
 Where to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Honeyland
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Honeyland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
