SUMMARY:Film: Small Axe: Lovers Rock (2020)
DESCRIPTION:Steve McQueen · 68 min\n\nOne night at a house party in 1980s 
 West London\, among the Black British community. Almost plotless\, it is p
 ure atmosphere\, music and joy. Part of McQueen's Small Axe series.\n\nAft
 er: How does a community create safety and joy when the world outside is h
 ostile?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Small%20A
 xe%3A%20Lovers%20Rock
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Small%20Axe%3A%20Lovers%20Rock
