SUMMARY:Film: Atlantics (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Mati Diop · 106 min\n\nIn Dakar\, construction workers who hav
 e not been paid set off across the sea for Spain\, and the women they leav
 e behind begin to change. Part love story\, part ghost story\, part protes
 t about migration and labour. Diop was the first Black woman director in c
 ompetition at Cannes.\n\nAfter: What drives people to risk everything to m
 igrate? Think about Senegal's 'teranga' and what home means.\n\nWhere to w
 atch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Atlantics
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Atlantics
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
