SUMMARY:Film: Roma (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Alfonso Cuarón · 135 min\n\nA year in the life of a live-in d
 omestic worker for a middle-class family in 1970s Mexico City\, drawn from
  Cuarón's own childhood. Shot in black and white\, it gives a usually inv
 isible woman the full weight of an epic. Politics and history unfold in th
 e background.\n\nAfter: Whose labour makes your daily life possible withou
 t you noticing it?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?
 q=Roma
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Roma
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
