SUMMARY:Film: Bicycle Thieves (1948)
DESCRIPTION:Vittorio De Sica · 89 min\n\nIn post-war Rome\, a man's bicycl
 e\, which he needs for his new job\, is stolen\, and he and his son search
  the city for it. A landmark of Italian neorealism\, made with non-profess
 ional actors on real streets. Simple\, honest and unforgettable.\n\nAfter:
  How much does one job\, or one small thing\, hold a family together?\n\nW
 here to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Bicycle%20Thieves
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Bicycle%20Thieves
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
