SUMMARY:Film: Man on Wire (2008)
DESCRIPTION:James Marsh · 94 min\n\nIn 1974\, Philippe Petit walked a tigh
 trope between the Twin Towers in New York. Told like a heist film\, with r
 econstructions and real footage. It won the Oscar for Best Documentary.\n\
 nAfter: What do you think pushes someone to do something so beautiful and 
 so pointless?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Man
 %20on%20Wire
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Man%20on%20Wire
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
