SUMMARY:Film: Cléo from 5 to 7 (1962)
DESCRIPTION:Agnès Varda · 90 min\n\nA young singer wanders Paris while wa
 iting for the results of a medical test\, in almost real time. A key film 
 of the French New Wave by one of its few women directors. It moves from be
 ing looked at to looking.\n\nAfter: Simone de Beauvoir wrote that one beco
 mes a woman. How does Cléo 'become' someone different over two hours?\n\n
 Where to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Cl%C3%A9o%20from%205
 %20to%207
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Cl%C3%A9o%20from%205%20to%207
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
