SUMMARY:Film: Aftersun (2022)
DESCRIPTION:Charlotte Wells · 102 min\n\nA Scottish woman remembers a holi
 day in Turkey with her young father when she was eleven. On the surface it
  is a sunny package holiday\; underneath\, it slowly reveals his struggle 
 with depression. A debut film that quietly devastates many viewers.\n\nAft
 er: How well do we ever know the inner lives of the people who raised us?\
 n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Aftersun
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Aftersun
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
