SUMMARY:Film: Belle (2013)
DESCRIPTION:Amma Asante · 104 min\n\nBased on Dido Elizabeth Belle\, the m
 ixed-race great-niece of Lord Mansfield\, raised in an aristocratic family
  in eighteenth-century England. Her story runs alongside the legal case th
 at shaped the abolition of the slave trade. Inspired by a real painting at
  Scone Palace.\n\nAfter: Think about the art cards: how have portraits sha
 ped who seems to matter in history?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwat
 ch.com/uk/search?q=Belle
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Belle
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
