SUMMARY:Film: Summer of Soul (2021)
DESCRIPTION:Ahmir 'Questlove' Thompson · 117 min\n\nIn 1969\, the Harlem C
 ultural Festival featured Stevie Wonder\, Nina Simone\, Mahalia Jackson an
 d more\, but the footage sat in a basement for fifty years. Joyful and pol
 itical\, about Black pride and music. It won the Oscar for Best Documentar
 y.\n\nAfter: Who decides which events become history?\n\nWhere to watch: h
 ttps://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Summer%20of%20Soul
