SUMMARY:Film: Carol (2015)
DESCRIPTION:Todd Haynes · 118 min\n\nIn 1950s New York\, a young shop assi
 stant and an elegant\, older married woman fall in love. Adapted from Patr
 icia Highsmith\, it is shot on film to look like old photographs. Glamorou
 s\, careful and full of longing\, much like Gatsby's world.\n\nAfter: How 
 did law and social pressure in the 1950s shape who could love whom?\n\nWhe
 re to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Carol
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Carol
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
