SUMMARY:Film: Daughters of the Dust (1991)
DESCRIPTION:Julie Dash · 112 min\n\nIn 1902\, a Gullah family on an island
  off South Carolina prepares to move north. It was the first feature by an
  African American woman to get a general release in the US. Its dreamlike 
 images later inspired Beyoncé's Lemonade.\n\nAfter: What is kept\, and wh
 at is lost\, when a family leaves its home for a better life?\n\nWhere to 
 watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Daughters%20of%20the%20Dust
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Daughters%20of%20the%20Dust
