SUMMARY:Film: The Farewell (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Lulu Wang · 100 min\n\nA Chinese American family keeps a cance
 r diagnosis secret from their grandmother\, staging a fake wedding as an e
 xcuse to say goodbye. Based on 'an actual lie' from Wang's own family. Fun
 ny and moving about culture and duty.\n\nAfter: Is it ever right to keep t
 he truth from someone for their own good?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.j
 ustwatch.com/uk/search?q=The%20Farewell
