 lavery in the US\, except as punishment for a crime. DuVernay traces how t
 hat exception connects to mass incarceration today. It includes voices fro
 m left and right.\n\nAfter: What was the strongest point from people the f
 ilm disagrees with?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search
 ?q=13th
