SUMMARY:Film: Parasite (2019)
DESCRIPTION:Bong Joon-ho · 132 min\n\nA poor family cons its way into work
 ing for a rich one\, and things spiral. Funny\, tense and shocking\, it wa
 s the first non-English language film to win the Oscar for Best Picture. A
  sharp look at class and inequality.\n\nAfter: How would a socialist and a
  free-market thinker each explain what goes wrong in this film?\n\nWhere t
 o watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Parasite
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Parasite
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
