SUMMARY:Film: Timbuktu (2014)
DESCRIPTION:Abderrahmane Sissako · 97 min\n\nJihadist militants take over 
 Timbuktu and ban music\, football and more. The film shows everyday resist
 ance with dignity\, beauty and even humour. Sissako avoids easy villains\,
  which makes it more powerful.\n\nAfter: How do ordinary people resist wit
 hout weapons?\n\nWhere to watch: https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Tim
 buktu
URL:https://www.justwatch.com/uk/search?q=Timbuktu
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
